be0936467{\nmargin-top:0;\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-5gql2z-8464e24b54cbdfbcca89a5cbe0936467 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5gql2z-8464e24b54cbdfbcca89a5cbe0936467 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-gx8yj-94c7543a5cd5b70f8930f1b45b68105d sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-gx8yj-94c7543a5cd5b70f8930f1b45b68105d av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mnhd8y6b-e58a4eeaa2ddcc103410d83bb00be4b0 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Ju\u017c w dniach <strong>8\u201312 wrze\u015bnia 2026<\/strong> b\u0119dziemy obecni na jednych z najwa\u017cniejszych targ\u00f3w bran\u017cy motoryzacyjnej &#8211; Automechanika Frankfurt.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Hala 12 | Stoisko E47<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Serdecznie zapraszamy do odwiedzenia naszego stoiska, gdzie zaprezentujemy ofert\u0119 wysokiej jako\u015bci olej\u00f3w smarowych, w tym produkt\u00f3w na bazie PAO, oraz dodatk\u00f3w do olej\u00f3w.<\/p>\n<p>To doskona\u0142a okazja, aby pozna\u0107 nasze rozwi\u0105zania, porozmawia\u0107 o mo\u017cliwo\u015bciach wsp\u00f3\u0142pracy i spotka\u0107 si\u0119 z naszym zespo\u0142em.<\/p>\n<p>Do zobaczenia we Frankfurcie!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-2794a3-273bbf8bb532904d9a42034de2fb55c9 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_a